Protocol Goedel.Contacts  Devices Devices
	Extern JmapBase
	Extern Resource
	CamelCase

	//  Uses some funky formatting, need to extend the serializer
	// Where Multiple is marked // Funky
	//  "member1", "member2"] is encoded as
	// { "member1" : true, "member2" : true }

	// 2. Card
	Structure JsDevice
		Inherits JmapBase
		Tag "Device"

		Description
			| Metadata, 


		String					Version
			Required
			Description
				| The JSContact version of this Card. If specified, value MUST be '1.0'


		String					Kind
			Description
				| The kind of the entity the Card represents.
				| individual: a single person
				| group: a group of people or entities
				| org: an organization
				| location: a named location
				| device: a device such as an appliance, a computer, or a network element
				| application: a software application
		
		String					Language
			Description
				| The language tag, as defined in [RFC5646], that best describes the language 
				| used for text in the Card, optionally including additional information such 
				| as the script. Note that values MAY be localized in the localizations 
				| property.

		String					Members
			Dictionary
			Description
				| The set of Cards that are members of this group Card. Each key in the set is 
				| the uid property value of the member, and each boolean value MUST be "true".
				| If this property is set, then the value of the kind property MUST be "group"


		String					DeviceId
			Description
				|

		String					ModelId
			Description
				|


		String					ModelName
			Description
				|

		String					Manufacturer
			Description
				|

		DateTime				DateManufacture
			Description
				|

		Struct Media			Images
			Multiple
			Description
				|

		Struct Media			Manuals
			Multiple
			Description
				|

		Struct Media			Guides
			Multiple
			Description
				|

		Struct Bootstrap		Bootstraps
			Multiple
			Description
				|

		Struct Provisioning		Provisioning
			Multiple
			Description
				|

		Struct Service			Services
			Multiple
			Description
				|

		Struct Maintenance		Maintenance
			Multiple
			Description
				|

		Struct Consumable		Consumables
			Multiple
			Description
				|

		Struct Accessory		Accessories
			Multiple
			Description
				|


		// 2.7.  Multilingual Properties
		// 2.7.1.  localizations
		Struct PatchObject		Localizations
			Dictionary
			Description
				| The property values localized to languages other than the main language 
				| (Section 2.1.5) of the Card. Localizations provide language-specific alternatives 
				| for existing property values and SHOULD NOT add new properties. The keys in 
				| the localizations property value are language tags [RFC5646]; the values 
				| are of type PatchObject and localize the Card in that language tag. The paths 
				| in the PatchObject are relative to the Card that includes the localizations
				| property. A patch MUST NOT target the localizations property.



		// JsonWebKeys
		Struct Jwks		JsonWebKeys
			Tag "jwks"
			Dictionary
			Description
				| The cryptographic resources such as public keys and certificates associated 
				| with the entity represented by the Card.


	Structure Bootstrap

	Structure Provisioning

	Structure Network

	Structure Service


	Structure Maintenance

	Structure Consumable
		Inherits Resource


	Structure Accessory
		Inherits Resource